<FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman">Dear eBay Member,</FONT><BR>
<FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman">&nbsp;</FONT><BR>
<FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman">Due to recent activity, including possible unauthorized listings, we </FONT><BR>
