      3: El Puesto a Cubrir<SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">&nbsp;</SPAN></span><SPAN 
      style="COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
      </SPAN><O:P></O:P></SPAN></font></P>
      <P class=MsoNormal 
      style="text-indent: 0px; line-height: 100%; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin-left: 8px; margin-right: 8px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">Unidad
      4:
      Reclutamiento<SPAN 
      style="mso-tab-count: 1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><O:P></O:P></span></font></P>
      <P class=MsoNormal 
      style="text-indent: 0px; line-height: 100%; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin-left: 8px; margin-right: 8px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">Unidad
      5: Seleccion<SPAN 
      style="mso-tab-count: 1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><O:P></O:P></span></font></P>
      <P class=MsoNormal 
