        <P align=left><FONT size=1><STRONG><FONT 
        face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><STRONG><FONT 
        color=#cc0000><A 
        href='http://loyalty-solutions.com/080E181D0117321F1D1C19170B5C1D00150E43404B404A410E45420E400E4145454A4646420E08.aspx'>&ordm; <STRONG>Innovation Works: Email Redesign Increases Loyalty Effectiveness</STRONG></A></FONT></STRONG></FONT></STRONG></FONT></P>
        <P><FONT size=1><STRONG><FONT 
